# Development Workflow

## Before Implementation
- Read `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` and `docs/DEV_GUIDE.md`
- Identify required agent consultations from matrix above

## During Implementation
- Invoke domain agents per consultation matrix
- Follow source tree policy and layer dependency rules

## After Implementation (strict order, fail-fast by cost)

**Scope gate**: Steps 1-4 apply only when source-affecting files are modified (e.g., source code, build config, dependencies). Non-source changes (docs, agent definitions, config prose) skip steps 1-4 entirely.

### 1. Lint
- Run linter if available
- Cheapest check — catches trivial issues immediately

### 2. Review Gate (before build)
- Run **review-orchestrator** for final validation
- BLOCKING items must pass before proceeding to build
- STRONG items must be documented if skipped

### 3. Build
- Run project build command
- Must succeed before running tests

### 4. Test
- Run test suite after build passes
- All tests must pass before declaring complete
